  "director_notes": "A fire-imbued spin: an off-hand sign lights the blade, then blade_out with a two-turn spin (1000 ms, about 450 ms a turn). The wheel is a slash layer with a long trail and a low inner edge so it reads as a solid ribbon of flame; the burning ring is a steady ground ring at the blade's radius over a faint scorch. Enemies flinch as the flame passes (sweep order), then are knocked back by the burst."
